{'symbol': 'NVDA', 'date': '2022-10-18 12:00:00', 'title': 'ORACLE AND NVIDIA PARTNER TO SPEED AI ADOPTION FOR ENTERPRISES', 'text': 'ORACLE CLOUD INFRASTRUCTURE GETS SUPERCHARGED WITH MAJOR GPU EXPANSION SUPPORTING FULL STACK OF NVIDIA AI SOFTWARE AND SERVICES LAS VEGAS , OCT. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ORACLE\xa0CLOUDWORLD --\xa0EXPANDING THEIR LONGSTANDING ALLIANCE, ORACLE AND NVIDIA TODAY ANNOUNCED A MULTI-YEAR PARTNERSHIP TO HELP CUSTOMERS SOLVE BUSINESS CHALLENGES WITH ACCELERATED COMPUTING AND AI.\xa0THE COLLABORATION AIMS TO BRING THE FULL NVIDIA ACCELERATED COMPUTING STACK — FROM GPUS TO SYSTEMS TO SOFTWARE — TO ORACLE CLOUD INFRASTRUCTURE (OCI).'}